;; giemon-factory-r0 — 建材 + 設備 台帳 (building-materials + equipment ledger),
;; Datomic-style EDN. SSoT for every physical element of the Giemon robot
;; manufacturing plant simulated by `kami-app-giemon-factory` (ADR-2606010030).
;;
;; Same shape as the kabitori `parts.edn` so `kotoba_gen.py` reuses the EDN
;; reader: each part becomes one kotoba entity whose claims are kg/claim/part/*
;; datoms (EAVT, ADR-2605312345); the whole file also emits a CycloneDX SBOM.
;;
;; :part/group        A-foundation · B-steel-frame · C-roof · D-cladding ·
;;                    E-mep · F-equipment · G-electrical · H-water · I-gas ·
;;                    J-fire-safety · K-site (外構/外部動線) · L-raw-materials (原材料)
;;                    (A-E,G-K = 建材/設備建物側, F = 生産設備, L = bulk 原材料)
;; :part/procurement  :cots       — buy off-the-shelf (has :part/manufacturer + :part/purl)
;;                    :custom-fab — cast / weld / commission on site (has :part/fab-process)
;; :part/sim-feature  links the part to a render element id in factory.scene.json
;;                    (and to the construction.edn :step/reveals targets), where applicable.
;; :part/sourcing     :representative — R0 design selection, NOT a procurement-verified
;;                    purchase or building-permit decision. Confirm before buying/building.

{:bom/meta
 {:bom/of          "giemon-factory-r0"
  :bom/revision    "v1"
  :bom/title       "Giemon robot manufacturing plant — R0 building + equipment BOM"
  :bom/currency    "JPY"
  :bom/sourcing    :representative
  :bom/note        "R0 design BOM for an 80m x 50m single-bay light-assembly plant (full MEP + 外構) that manufactures the giemon robot line. Building shell (A-E) + utilities (G electrical / H water / I gas / J fire) routed as kami-genesis geometry; site/外部動線 (K) outside the bay; raw materials (L) as bulk inputs; equipment (F) as CAD + giemon arm6 work-cells. Manufacturer/MPN/数量/length-m/area-m2 are representative R0 design figures, NOT a finalized purchase, 確認申請, 消防同意, or 受電/受水/ガス供給契約."}

